	measure '% Total Cost' = ```
			VAR _cost =  DIVIDE([Total Cost], [Grand Total Cost])
			                RETURN
			                    CONCATENATE(IF(_cost > 0.10, "⬆️ ", "⬇️ "),FORMAT(_cost, "#.00%;(-#.00%)"))  
			```
